title: "DCQC: Data and code quality control for ecology and evolutionary biology"
abstract: "A Shiny application implementing the SORTEE guidelines for data and code quality control, allowing data editors and reviewers to assess archived data and code against a fifteen-item, six-stage checklist and export a report."
